    "created_at": "2019-04-24T10:36:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-24T10:36:05Z",
    "body": "We can't argue that performance is a driving factor, since the underlying platform graphics APIs might not use the same values in their bitmasks. In fact, I doubt they do.\r\n\r\nBut even if writeMask in my example was a dictionary type, how would I provide a default value of \"all\"?",
