    "body": "There's not a direct mapping from bitmasks (for which I'm not sure we've got established JavaScript design patterns as they're avoided) that I know of. So you'd have to start from use cases and requirements and build something new up from there. (If you wanted to dig into this more the TAG and TC39 in particular would be good places to discuss this I think.)",
