    "created_at": "2019-04-25T05:03:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-04-25T05:03:14Z",
    "body": "Constants are already marked as having their usage discouraged. What if, in conjunction with adding this permitted usage, we somehow made this recommendation somehow stronger, or even specifically referencing WebGL as a big incumbent user which will remain an exception to the rule?",
