    "updated_at": "2019-04-25T22:35:51Z",
    "body": "So you're saying that you'd allow WebGPU to do it, but then recommend against what WebGPU is doing? That's a bit weird, but if it allows us to use a constant as a default value, then I'm ok with it.\r\n\r\nThe use of bitmasks is another issue. ",
